## 🖥️ Local Development

### Prerequisites
- PHP 8.3+
- Composer
- MySQL 8.0+
- Node.js & npm (untuk Tailwind CSS)

### Setup Lokal
```bash
# Clone repository
git clone <your-repo-url>
cd project_uas

# Install dependencies
composer install
npm install

# Copy environment file
cp .env.example .env

# Generate application key
php artisan key:generate

# Setup database di .env
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=portfolio_db
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=

# Run migrations
php artisan migrate

# Build assets
npm run build

# Start development server
php artisan serve
```

Buka http://localhost:8000

---

## 🚂 Deploy ke Railway

Railway adalah platform hosting all-in-one yang ideal untuk Laravel dengan MySQL built-in.

### Step 1: Persiapan Repository (5 menit)

#### 1.1 Push ke GitHub
```bash
# Initialize git (jika belum)
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit - Portfolio Laravel"

# Push ke GitHub
git remote add origin https://github.com/username/your-repo.git
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main
```

#### 1.2 File Deployment Sudah Siap ✅
Project ini sudah include:
- ✅ `Procfile` - Railway start command
- ✅ `nixpacks.toml` - Build configuration
- ✅ `.gitignore` - Ignore sensitive files

### Step 2: Setup Railway Account (2 menit)

1. Buka [railway.app](https://railway.app)
2. Klik **"Login with GitHub"**
3. Authorize Railway untuk akses repository Anda
4. Dapatkan **$5 free credit/bulan** (cukup untuk portfolio)

### Step 3: Deploy Laravel App (5 menit)

#### 3.1 Create New Project
1. Dashboard Railway → **"New Project"**
2. Pilih **"Deploy from GitHub repo"**
3. Pilih repository `project_uas`
4. Railway akan auto-detect Laravel dan mulai deploy

#### 3.2 Tunggu Build Selesai
- Build time: ~2-3 menit
- Status: Lihat di **Deployments** tab
- Jika error, cek **Build Logs**

### Step 4: Setup MySQL Database (3 menit)

#### 4.1 Add MySQL Service
1. Di project dashboard → **"+ New"**
2. Pilih **"Database"** → **"Add MySQL"**
3. Railway akan provision MySQL instance
4. Tunggu status **"Active"** (hijau)

#### 4.2 Copy Database Credentials
1. Klik MySQL service
2. Tab **"Variables"**
3. Copy credentials:
   - `MYSQLHOST`
   - `MYSQLPORT`
   - `MYSQLDATABASE`
   - `MYSQLUSER`
   - `MYSQLPASSWORD`

### Step 5: Configure Environment Variables (5 menit)

#### 5.1 Laravel App Variables
1. Klik Laravel service (bukan MySQL)
2. Tab **"Variables"**
3. Klik **"+ New Variable"**

Tambahkan **satu per satu**:

```env
# App Config
APP_NAME="Portfolio Laravel"
APP_ENV=production
APP_DEBUG=false
APP_URL=https://your-app.up.railway.app

# Generate di local, copy hasilnya
APP_KEY=base64:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Database (paste dari MySQL service)
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=${MYSQLHOST}
DB_PORT=${MYSQLPORT}
DB_DATABASE=${MYSQLDATABASE}
DB_USERNAME=${MYSQLUSER}
DB_PASSWORD=${MYSQLPASSWORD}

# Cloudinary (copy dari .env lokal Anda)
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your_cloud_name
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your_api_key
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your_api_secret
CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=your_upload_preset

# Session & Cache
SESSION_DRIVER=file
CACHE_DRIVER=file
QUEUE_CONNECTION=sync

# Log
LOG_CHANNEL=stack
LOG_LEVEL=error
```

#### 5.2 Generate APP_KEY
**Di terminal lokal:**
```bash
php artisan key:generate --show
```
Copy output `base64:...` ke Railway variable `APP_KEY`

#### 5.3 Simpan Variables
Klik **"Deploy"** - Railway akan restart dengan config baru

### Step 6: Run Database Migrations (2 menit)

#### 6.1 Buka Railway Console
1. Laravel service → **"..."** (3 dots) → **"Shell"**
2. Atau install Railway CLI:
   ```bash
   npm install -g @railway/cli
   railway login
   railway link
   ```

#### 6.2 Run Migrations
**Via Web Console atau CLI:**
```bash
php artisan migrate --force
```

Output:
```
Migration table created successfully.
Migrating: 2024_01_01_000000_create_projects_table
Migrated:  2024_01_01_000000_create_projects_table (XXms)
```

### Step 7: Setup Admin Account (1 menit)

**Via Railway Console:**
```bash
php artisan tinker
```

Lalu paste:
```php
$admin = new App\Models\User;
$admin->name = 'Admin';
$admin->email = 'admin@example.com';
$admin->password = bcrypt('your-secure-password');
$admin->save();
exit
```

### Step 8: Access Your App 🎉

1. Railway dashboard → Laravel service
2. Tab **"Settings"** → **"Domains"**
3. Copy domain: `https://your-app-xxxxx.up.railway.app`
4. Buka di browser!

**Login Console:**
- URL: `https://your-app.up.railway.app/console/access`
- Email: `admin@example.com`
- Password: (yang Anda set di Step 7)

---

## 🔐 Environment Variables

### Required Variables

| Variable | Description | Example |
|----------|-------------|---------|
| `APP_ENV` | Environment mode | `production` |
| `APP_DEBUG` | Debug mode (false di production) | `false` |
| `APP_KEY` | Laravel encryption key | `base64:...` |
| `APP_URL` | Public URL aplikasi | `https://your-app.up.railway.app` |
| `DB_HOST` | MySQL host | `containers-us-west-xxx.railway.app` |
| `DB_PORT` | MySQL port | `3306` |
| `DB_DATABASE` | Database name | `railway` |
| `DB_USERNAME` | Database user | `root` |
| `DB_PASSWORD` | Database password | (auto-generated) |
| `CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME` | Cloudinary cloud | `dducuhzso` |
| `CLOUDINARY_API_KEY` | Cloudinary key | `381236954385957` |
| `CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET` | Cloudinary secret | (your secret) |
| `CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET` | Upload preset | `portofolio_anyx` |

### Optional Variables
```env
SESSION_DRIVER=file
CACHE_DRIVER=file
QUEUE_CONNECTION=sync
LOG_CHANNEL=stack
LOG_LEVEL=error
```

