## 💰 Railway Pricing

### Free Tier
- **$5 credit/bulan** (auto-renew)
- Cukup untuk:
  - 1 Laravel app (low-medium traffic)
  - 1 MySQL database (hingga 500MB)
  - ~500 jam uptime/bulan

### Hobby Plan ($5/bulan)
- **$5 credit + $5 plan** = $10/bulan usage
- No sleep time
- Priority support
- Untuk traffic lebih tinggi

### Usage Estimasi Portfolio
- Laravel app: ~$2-3/bulan
- MySQL 500MB: ~$1/bulan
- **Total: ~$3-4/bulan** (dalam free tier!)

