## 🎯 Quick Reference

### Railway Commands (CLI)
```bash
# Login
railway login

# Link project
railway link

# View logs
railway logs

# Open console
railway shell

# View variables
railway variables

# Deploy manually
railway up
```

### Laravel Commands (Production)
```bash
# Migrations
php artisan migrate --force

# Cache optimization
php artisan optimize

# Clear all caches
php artisan optimize:clear

# View routes
php artisan route:list

# Check app status
php artisan about
```

